# Before: the back-edge held -> confirmed runs against the reading direction and ELK kinks it
# (an 11px jog between two bends).
...@neutral-theme
direction: down
placed: Placed {class: state}
awaiting: Awaiting payment {class: state}
confirmed: Confirmed {class: [state; focal]}
shipping: Shipping {class: state}
held: Held {class: state}
placed -> awaiting: {class: dep}
awaiting -> confirmed: {class: dep}
confirmed -> shipping: {class: dep}
shipping -> held: {class: dep}
held -> confirmed: {class: dep}
awaiting -> held: {class: dep}
